Package: sezgi
Title: Metaheuristic Optimization with a Rust Core
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tolga", "Berber", email = "tolga.berber@fen.ktu.edu.tr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R frontend for the sezgi metaheuristic optimization library.
    Algorithms are serializable component graphs executed by a Rust core with
    reproducible, bit-exact cross-language trajectories.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
Imports: R6 (>= 2.4.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), jsonlite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
